Oh, Astro Cleaners on St. James Place is the only place that is open on that day.
噢，圣詹姆斯广场的Astro干洗店是那天唯一开门的店。

120
00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:37.320
Unbelievable.
难以置信。

121
00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.200
Unbelievable.
难以置信。

122
00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.880
Michael is, he is so turned on by her knowledge.
迈克尔，他完全被她的博学迷住了。

123
00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:44.980
Unbelievable.
难以置信。

124
