138
00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.430
Oh, my head's going to explode with happiness.
噢，我的头都要因为幸福而炸开了。

139
00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:26.610
Just pure joy.
纯粹的喜悦。

140
00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:26.850
