00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.120
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

518
00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:54.180
But the checks were.
但支票倒是。

519
00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:55.980
It went out of business.
它倒闭了。

520
00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.220
It went out of business whilst we were filming.
就在我们拍摄的时候它倒闭了。

521
00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:01.420
But we just kept going because we figured, well, someone's going to pick it up.
但我们还是继续拍，因为我们想，总会有人接手的。

522
00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:05.280
So then we knocked out a bunch of episodes and two more movies.
于是我们一口气拍了好几集，还有两部电影。

523
00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:06.960
Yeah.
是啊。

524
00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.960
