I mean, I will come skate through the halls of St. Dennis Medical with you.
我是说，我会陪你一起溜冰穿过圣丹尼斯医疗中心的走廊。

706
00:27:24.460 --> 00:27:24.860
I mean.
我是说。

707
00:27:25.020 --> 00:27:26.000
And we want this.
我们想要这样。

708
00:27:26.000 --> 00:27:26.460
You too.
你也是。

709
00:27:26.920 --> 00:27:27.720
Look at you.
看看你。

710
00:27:27.920 --> 00:27:28.740
Look at us.
看看我们。

711
00:27:28.940 --> 00:27:30.540
We should be skating together.
我们应该一起溜冰的。

712
00:27:30.600 --> 00:27:31.440
We should be.
我们确实应该。

713
00:27:31.460 --> 00:27:31.820
Okay.
好的。

714
00:27:31.960 --> 00:27:32.180
Sorry.
抱歉。

715
00:27:32.420 --> 00:27:33.100
I got very excited.
我太兴奋了。

716
00:27:33.420 --> 00:27:35.400
I got very excited about roller skating.
我对溜旱冰感到太兴奋了。

717
00:27:45.400 --> 00:27:49.560
You know, speaking of St. Dennis Medical, we got a lot of letters from people who are
说到圣丹尼斯医疗中心，我们收到了很多来信，写信的人都是

718
00:27:49.560 --> 00:27:52.240
fans of the show and of you specifically.
这部剧的粉丝，尤其是你的粉丝。

719
00:27:52.620 --> 00:27:54.380
We have started watching it.
我们已经开始看了。

720
00:27:54.800 --> 00:27:55.660
We love it.
我们很喜欢。

721
00:27:55.800 --> 00:27:56.420
It's so good.
太棒了。

722
00:27:56.600 --> 00:27:57.120
Thank you.
谢谢。

723
00:27:57.180 --> 00:27:58.480
What a phenomenal caSt.
演员阵容真是太强大了。

724
00:27:58.800 --> 00:27:59.700
Thank you.
谢谢。

725
00:28:00.060 --> 00:28:00.300
Yes.
是的。

726
00:28:00.300 --> 00:28:01.960
You just got picked up for season two.
你们刚续订了第二季。

727
00:28:02.200 --> 00:28:02.640
Congratulations.
恭喜。

728
00:28:02.760 --> 00:28:03.300
Thank you.
谢谢。

729
00:28:03.420 --> 00:28:03.860
Thank you.
谢谢。

730
00:28:03.860 --> 00:28:04.380
Thank you.
谢谢。

731
00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:06.040
What can you tell us about working on it?
关于拍摄这部剧，你能跟我们分享些什么吗？

732
00:28:06.260 --> 00:28:09.240
Well, you guys know Justin.
嗯，你们认识贾斯汀。

733
00:28:09.620 --> 00:28:10.120
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

734
00:28:10.680 --> 00:28:11.620
Justin Spitzer.
贾斯汀·斯皮策。

735
00:28:11.980 --> 00:28:14.560
And he is the loveliest man.
他是个最可爱的人。

736
00:28:14.780 --> 00:28:15.540
So wonderful.
太棒了。

737
00:28:15.840 --> 00:28:16.900
Such a nice person.
人特别好。

738
00:28:16.900 --> 00:28:23.180
And for your listeners that have watched St. Dennis, Justin was in our episode where we
对于看过《圣丹尼斯》的听众来说，贾斯汀曾出现在我们的一集里，当时我们

