00:28:27.980 --> 00:28:33.940
And he's the one that did a somersault and juggled and then walked off stage.
他就是那个翻了跟头、玩杂耍然后走下舞台的人。

741
00:28:34.140 --> 00:28:35.080
That was our Justin.
那就是我们的贾斯汀。

