I would guarantee you're going to get at least four good hours.
我敢保证你至少能睡上四个小时好觉。

1397
00:53:50.270 --> 00:53:50.530
Okay.
好吧。

1398
00:53:51.190 --> 00:53:51.610
Okay.
好吧。

1399
00:53:51.910 --> 00:53:52.150
Yeah.
是啊。

