Hot flashes are its own devil.
潮热真是个磨人的小妖精。

1402
00:53:56.170 --> 00:53:56.350
Yeah.
是啊。

1403
00:53:56.930 --> 00:53:58.190
Do you turn the air on?
你有开空调吗？

1404
00:53:58.590 --> 00:54:03.470
So I sleep with a fan blowing on my side of the bed.
所以我睡觉时会在床边开个风扇。

1405
00:54:03.670 --> 00:54:03.810
Okay.
好的。

1406
00:54:03.810 --> 00:54:05.350
It's this big stand-up fan.
是个很大的立式风扇。

1407
00:54:05.610 --> 00:54:05.830
Okay.
好的。

1408
00:54:06.090 --> 00:54:14.050
We need to put a piece of glow tape on it because I need it positioned like really kind
我们需要在上面贴块荧光胶带，因为我得把它摆在床正前方，

1409
00:54:14.050 --> 00:54:19.470
of right in front of the bed, but it's also right in the walkway to the bathroom.
但它正好挡在去洗手间的过道上。

1410
00:54:19.990 --> 00:54:22.030
Oh, so you run into it all the time.
噢，所以你们总是会撞到它。

1411
