And that's going to wake you up, too, isn't it?
而且那也会把你吵醒，对吧？

1416
00:54:34.750 --> 00:54:35.670
It really is.
确实会。

1417
00:54:35.750 --> 00:54:36.450
It really is.
确实会。

1418
00:54:36.550 --> 00:54:39.410
So we just, we need to, I don't know.
所以我们只是，我不知道该怎么办。

1419
00:54:39.470 --> 00:54:42.490
And at night, I'll say, hey, everybody, don't run into the fan.
晚上我会叮嘱大家，嘿，别撞到风扇。

1420
00:54:43.050 --> 00:54:45.890
If you have to come in, don't remember, don't run into mom's fan.
如果你们要进来，记得别撞到妈妈的风扇。

1421
00:54:46.010 --> 00:54:46.330
Right.
没错。

1422
00:54:46.610 --> 00:54:48.370
And then they all just—
然后他们就全都——

1423
00:54:48.370 --> 00:54:49.630
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1424
00:54:50.070 --> 00:54:50.350
Oh, gosh.
天哪。

1425
00:54:50.350 --> 00:54:51.050
There we go.
好了。

1426
00:54:52.270 --> 00:54:53.290
That's hilarious.
太搞笑了。

1427
00:54:54.510 --> 00:54:58.170
Wendy, thank you so much for being on our podcaSt.
温迪，非常感谢你来参加我们的播客。

1428
00:54:58.590 --> 00:54:58.650
Thank you.
谢谢。

1429
00:54:58.650 --> 00:54:59.790
Thank you for having me.
谢谢你们邀请我。

1430
00:54:59.970 --> 00:55:02.330
I hope I didn't bloviate for too long.
希望我没有啰嗦太久。

1431
00:55:02.530 --> 00:55:04.510
You did not bloviate at all.
你一点都没啰嗦。

1432
00:55:04.510 --> 00:55:06.570
You are just, you're just a badass.
你简直太厉害了。

1433
00:55:06.950 --> 00:55:09.510
You are so funny and so smart.
你又风趣又聪明。

1434
00:55:09.690 --> 00:55:13.870
And we are just thrilled to just have had this time with you.
能有这段时间和你交流，我们感到非常激动。

1435
00:55:13.970 --> 00:55:15.650
You are talking about yourself.
你这是在说你自己吧。

1436
00:55:16.230 --> 00:55:18.450
You are talking about yourself.
你这是在说你自己吧。

1437
00:55:18.570 --> 00:55:20.050
You still have it.
你依然风采不减当年。

1438
00:55:21.070 --> 00:55:22.550
You are the badasses.
你们才是真正厉害的人。

1439
00:55:22.910 --> 00:55:27.270
I really appreciate how vulnerable you were in talking about, like, how you've been fired.
我很感激你愿意敞开心扉，谈论你被解雇的经历。

1440
00:55:27.570 --> 00:55:29.990
